        },
        "fields": {
          "notes": "The title page and RuNEB/RNL-derived card establish the Moscow 1899 Reader editorial-office Edition. The cataloged extent is 236 pages and the offprint note cites Reader books 16, 18–20, 26–28, and 30–35. The acquired digital object is fragmentary: 22 photographed spreads/pages expose the title page and selected printed pages through 139. Edition sequence, full collation, and translator attribution remain open."
        },
